Generate {{ num_docs }} English texts where short PII fragments are chained together and boundaries are easy to merge incorrectly.

## Purpose
Measure whether the model can split adjacent entities correctly when labels are absent and separators are weak.

## PII Tag Format
- `<PERSON>John Carter</PERSON>`
- `<ADDRESS>123 Market Street, San Francisco, CA</ADDRESS>`
- `<ORGANIZATION>Northwind Analytics LLC</ORGANIZATION>`
- `<DATE_OF_BIRTH>1990-03-15</DATE_OF_BIRTH>`
- `<BANK_ACCOUNT>Chase Bank Midtown Branch Checking 1234567</BANK_ACCOUNT>`

## Concrete Patterns

### 1. Fragment lists
- `<PERSON>John Carter</PERSON> / <PERSON>Mia Lopez</PERSON> / <ADDRESS>123 Market Street, San Francisco, CA</ADDRESS>`
- `<PERSON>Olivia Reed</PERSON> <DATE_OF_BIRTH>1988-06-15</DATE_OF_BIRTH> <ADDRESS>44 Pine Road, Seattle, WA</ADDRESS>`
- `<ORGANIZATION>Blue Harbor Systems Inc.</ORGANIZATION> <PERSON>Daniel Park</PERSON> <BANK_ACCOUNT>Chase Bank Midtown Branch Checking 1234567</BANK_ACCOUNT>`

### 2. Weakly separated notes
- `note <PERSON>Emma Hall</PERSON><PERSON>Noah Brooks</PERSON> <ADDRESS>88 River Ave, Austin, TX</ADDRESS>`
- `list <PERSON>Ava Stone</PERSON>·<PERSON>Liam Cole</PERSON>·<ORGANIZATION>Red Maple Logistics</ORGANIZATION>`
- `draft <PERSON>Grace Kim</PERSON> <ORGANIZATION>West Loop Data Lab</ORGANIZATION> <ADDRESS>205 Lake Street, Chicago, IL</ADDRESS>`

### 3. Symbol-heavy joins
- `<PERSON>Ella Moore</PERSON>|<DATE_OF_BIRTH>2001/07/21</DATE_OF_BIRTH>|<ADDRESS>77 Harbor Way, Boston, MA</ADDRESS>`
- `<PERSON>Lucas Price</PERSON>,<ORGANIZATION>Silver Tide Ventures</ORGANIZATION>,<BANK_ACCOUNT>Bank of America South Branch Checking 4567890</BANK_ACCOUNT>`
- `<ADDRESS>19 King Street, Denver, CO</ADDRESS>/<PERSON>Sophia Reed</PERSON>/<PERSON>Ethan Ford</PERSON>`

### 4. Role words only
- `reviewer <PERSON>Henry Scott</PERSON>`
- `org <ORGANIZATION>North Pier Holdings</ORGANIZATION>`
- `deposit <BANK_ACCOUNT>Wells Fargo Bay Branch Checking 9988776</BANK_ACCOUNT>`

## Output Format
- Separate each text with `---DOC_SEPARATOR---`
- Each text should be 60-220 characters
- Each text must include 3-6 PII entities across at least 2 entity types
